        "id": 1000253
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-05-17T21:25:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point. For thermal stuff we care more about precision at the upper end, so how about we increment step_mv if that makes v0 + (step_mv * num_steps) closer to v1?\n\nFor example:\nstep_mv \u003d (v1 - v0) / num_steps;\nd0 \u003d v1 - (v0 + step_mv * num_steps);\nd1 \u003d (v0 + (step_mv + 1) * num_steps) - v1;\nif (d1 \u003c d0)\n\tstep_mv++;",
      "parentUuid": "722d8476_3791c2a9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 128,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 128,
        "endChar": 34
      },
      "revId": "76e86ce6e0f03ce12dfb4ba8f14fece9bdaab627",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
